factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  The reel_script and caption say Loganeswaran is from Soolaimedu (Namachivayapuram) in the article, but the reel_script omits his residence; more importantly the tamil_headline and reel_script say Rs.1400 was 'robbed' (பறித்து) while the article says he sent the money via Google Pay believing a deceptive offer, so the headline's 'பறிப்பு' framing differs from the article's account of a trick (நூதனமுறை) payment, and the reel_script's claim that Deva 'ran away after jumping into an auto' is fine but the article says Deva jumped out of the auto, not that he ran
  The reel_script and slides_spec say the victim was attacked by Deva and Silambarasan with a knife (கத்தி மிரட்டினர் / தாக்கினர்); the article says Deva and his friend threatened him at knife-point and beat and chased him away, consistent, but the slides_spec headline 'பைக்டாக்சி ஓட்டுநர் மீது கத்தி' and caption 'இருவரும் லோகேஸ்வரனை தாக்கி விரட்டினர்' are acceptable, however the caption says Deva 'ஆன்லைன் செயலி மூலம்' booked, which the article says but the reel_script omits the detail that the victim's motorcycle was left behind at Saidapet
  The reel_script and caption omit that Loganeswaran left his motorcycle behind near Saidapet and boarded the second auto, an important sequence detail; the caption also says 'மோசடி' tactic detail 'ரூ.2000 தருகிறேன்' which the article states as 'ரூ.2ஆயிரம்' (same value), so no issue there
  The caption and reel_script both state 'சைதாப்பேட்டை அருகே ஆட்டோவை வழிமறித்தார்' which matches the article, but the slides_spec second slide says Deva said he would give Rs.2000 'தருவேன்' in first person while the article is reported speech, a minor grammatical inconsistency across drafts
  The caption closing line 'Chennai bycicist robbed | Chennai news' is in English, and the caption's 'மக்கள் கவனத்திற்கு' safety advice is an invented detail not present in the article
